## 2D Difference Array

For matrix range updates:

```text
Add val to rectangle:
(r1, c1) → (r2, c2)
```

Update only four cells:

```cpp
diff[r1][c1] += val;
diff[r1][c2 + 1] -= val;
diff[r2 + 1][c1] -= val;
diff[r2 + 1][c2 + 1] += val;
```

Then compute a 2D prefix sum.

Complexity:

```text
O(Q + rows × cols)
```

instead of:

```text
O(Q × rows × cols)
```

---

## Key Formula

For update:

```cpp
[l, r] += val
```

Do:

```cpp
diff[l] += val;

if (r + 1 < n)
    diff[r + 1] -= val;
```

Then:

```cpp
final = prefix_sum(diff);
```

---

## One-Line Intuition

Difference Array = Mark boundaries.

Prefix Sum = Spread the effect.

Remember:

```text
Prefix Sum  → Query Optimization
Difference Array → Update Optimization
```